### Food Saver API Test Suite (VS Code REST Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Get All Active Listings
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings

### 3. Create a New Food Bundle Listing (Merchant)
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantId": "m1",
  "merchantName": "Boulangerie Artisan",
  "title": "Fresh Sourdough & Pastry Assortment",
  "description": "5 fresh artisanal sourdough loaves and 4 croissants",
  "qty": 3,
  "originalPrice": 25.00,
  "discountPrice": 7.50,
  "minutesRemaining": 30,
  "lat": 37.7749,
  "lng": -122.4194
}

### 4. Claim a Listing (Resident)
# Replace {{listingId}} with a real ID from GET /listings
POST {{baseUrl}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listingId": "listing_1",
  "residentId": "res_101",
  "residentName": "Alex Rivera"
}

### 5. Verify / Redeem Pickup Token (Merchant Counter)
# Replace token code with token from step 4
POST {{baseUrl}}/claims/redeem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "TOK-1234"
}

### 6. Get NGO Rescued Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/ngo/notifications
